    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "The One Ring",
        "content": "While you control The One Ring you may draw a card at the start of your turn and add +2 to your attacks. \n\nIf an opponets controls The One Ring they may draw a card at the start of their turn and take 1 damage. Damage done this way cannot defeat an opponent.\n\nWhenever combat Damage is dealt to the owner of The One Ring, the player who dealt damage now controls The One Ring."
